    "factsheet": [
        {
            "heading": "To relationship with land and each other",
            "paragraphs": [
                "Coco Collective- Ital Community Gardens has been set up since Juneteenth 2019,  as a response to COVID to improve access to green spaces, respond to food insecurity and evidence cultural pathways for improved wellbeing for Black and global majority peoples in Lewisham",
                "We have two sites in Bellingham and Catford ( since 2023) where we offer intergenerational food growing workshops, mental wellbeing sessions through referrals, on site health checks with a GP at our Bellingham site, and food justice & race equity research projects."
            ]
        }
